# Downloaded papers (see docs/references.md). Kept out of git deliberately: these are
# copyrighted by IEEE, SPIE and others, and committing a PDF to a public repository
# redistributes it. The repository holds the citation and the DOI; the reader fetches
# the paper from the publisher.
papers/
